{"id":"b675c5b8c6d4fdff","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/717_ALN.md","title":"717 ALN","display":"717_ALN","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"717-ALN\">717 ALN</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\">\\(\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span> 是概念名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_R\">\\(N_R\\)</span> 是角色名集合。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>ALN 的概念构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{atomneg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{forall},\n\\operatorname{existsTop},\\operatorname{atleast},\\operatorname{atmost}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{atomneg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{forall},\n\\operatorname{existsTop},\\operatorname{atleast},\\operatorname{atmost}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{atomneg}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{atomneg}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{forall}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{existsTop}:N_R\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{forall}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{existsTop}:N_R\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atleast},\\operatorname{atmost}:\n\\mathbb N\\times N_R\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atleast},\\operatorname{atmost}:\n\\mathbb N\\times N_R\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号（概念位置的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\)</span>）：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=\\operatorname{top},\\quad\\bot=\\operatorname{bottom},\\quad\\neg A=\\operatorname{atomneg}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=\\operatorname{top},\\quad\\bot=\\operatorname{bottom},\\quad\\neg A=\\operatorname{atomneg}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D=\\operatorname{conj}(C,D),\\quad\\forall R.C=\\operatorname{forall}(R,C),\\quad\\exists R.\\top=\\operatorname{existsTop}(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\sqcap D=\\operatorname{conj}(C,D),\\quad\\forall R.C=\\operatorname{forall}(R,C),\\quad\\exists R.\\top=\\operatorname{existsTop}(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\geq nR=\\operatorname{atleast}(n,R),\n\\qquad\n\\leq nR=\\operatorname{atmost}(n,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\geq nR=\\operatorname{atleast}(n,R),\n\\qquad\n\\leq nR=\\operatorname{atmost}(n,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>数目限制是非限定的：构造子只含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，不含填充概念 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-概念表达式\">2. 概念表达式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span> 为满足下列条款的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atomneg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(\\operatorname{atomneg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(C\\sqcap D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.\\top\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(\\exists R.\\top\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\geq nR\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(\\geq nR\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq nR\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(\\leq nR\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-包含式与-TBox\">3. 包含式与 TBox</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n=\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n=\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>TBox 载体为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-自由名字与替换\">4. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg A)=\\{A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg A)=\\{A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.\\top)=\\{R\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.\\top)=\\{R\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\geq nR)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\leq nR)=\\{R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\geq nR)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\leq nR)=\\{R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无绑定名字函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个名字排序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\\)</span> 固定无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\">\\(e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span> 有限，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_C:N_C\\to N_C\">\\(\\theta_C:N_C\\to N_C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\">\\(\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad \\operatorname{Ren}(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad \\operatorname{Ren}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\operatorname{name}(\\theta_C(A)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Ren}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\theta_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\operatorname{name}(\\theta_C(A)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Ren}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\theta_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Ren}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Ren}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Ren}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Ren}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Ren}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Ren}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\exists R.\\top)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\top,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\exists R.\\top)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\top,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\geq nR)=\\geq n\\theta_R(R),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}(\\leq nR)=\\leq n\\theta_R(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\geq nR)=\\geq n\\theta_R(R),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}(\\leq nR)=\\leq n\\theta_R(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\">\\(\\forall R.C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\geq nR\">\\(\\geq nR\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq nR\">\\(\\leq nR\\)</span> 是角色限制构造子，不绑定概念名或角色名；捕获避免重命名就是保持排序的有限支撑替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span> 只用于选择未出现在有限名字集中的新名字。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALbase}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\geq}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\leq}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{clash}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALbase}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\geq}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\leq}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{clash}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>基础 AL 公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALbase}}\n=\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALbase}}\n=\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{A\\sqcap\\neg A\\sqsubseteq\\bot:A\\in N_C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{A\\sqcap\\neg A\\sqsubseteq\\bot:A\\in N_C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>数目下界单调：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\geq}\n=\n\\{\\geq mR\\sqsubseteq\\geq nR:R\\in N_R,\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n\\leq m\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\geq}\n=\n\\{\\geq mR\\sqsubseteq\\geq nR:R\\in N_R,\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n\\leq m\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>数目上界单调：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\leq}\n=\n\\{\\leq nR\\sqsubseteq\\leq mR:R\\in N_R,\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n\\leq m\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\leq}\n=\n\\{\\leq nR\\sqsubseteq\\leq mR:R\\in N_R,\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n\\leq m\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>上下界冲突：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{clash}}\n=\n\\{(\\geq mR)\\sqcap(\\leq nR)\\sqsubseteq\\bot:R\\in N_R,\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n&lt;m\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{clash}}\n=\n\\{(\\geq mR)\\sqcap(\\leq nR)\\sqsubseteq\\bot:R\\in N_R,\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n&lt;m\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 出发的 ALN 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 的下列五个许可条件至少一个成立（析取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是上述有型非空有限序列、每行满足五类许可的析取且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D)\">\\((C,D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导出关系\">8. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALN}}C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALN}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与解释\">9. 语义结构与解释</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\)</span> 是所有集合结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\\)</span> 的类谓词，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\(\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta)\">\\(\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALN}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\(⟦-⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALN}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span> 如下；以下省略固定的结构和系统标记。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\top⟧=\\Delta,\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧=\\varnothing,\\quad\n⟦ A⟧=\\iota_C(A),\\quad\n⟦\\neg A⟧=\\Delta\\setminus\\iota_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\top⟧=\\Delta,\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧=\\varnothing,\\quad\n⟦ A⟧=\\iota_C(A),\\quad\n⟦\\neg A⟧=\\Delta\\setminus\\iota_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ C\\sqcap D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cap⟦ D⟧,\n\\quad\n⟦\\forall R.C⟧=\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\forall y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ C\\sqcap D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cap⟦ D⟧,\n\\quad\n⟦\\forall R.C⟧=\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\forall y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\exists R.\\top⟧\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\n\\exists y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\exists R.\\top⟧\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\n\\exists y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\geq nR⟧=\\{x\\in\\Delta:|\\{y\\in\\Delta:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}|\\geq n\\},\n\\quad\n⟦\\leq nR⟧=\\{x\\in\\Delta:|\\{y\\in\\Delta:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}|\\leq n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\geq nR⟧=\\{x\\in\\Delta:|\\{y\\in\\Delta:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}|\\geq n\\},\n\\quad\n⟦\\leq nR⟧=\\{x\\in\\Delta:|\\{y\\in\\Delta:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}|\\leq n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-满足关系与语义后承\">10. 满足关系与语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALN}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ C⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\subseteq\n⟦ D⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALN}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALN}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ C⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\subseteq\n⟦ D⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALN}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALN}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALN}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALN}}I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALN}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALN}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALN}}I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-特征差异\">11. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>ALN 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{atleast},\\operatorname{atmost}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{atLeastConcept},\\operatorname{atMostConcept},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{exists}\\}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{atleast},\\operatorname{atmost}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{atLeastConcept},\\operatorname{atMostConcept},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{exists}\\}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一分量中的数目限制只以角色名为参数；第二分量排除带填充概念的限定数目限制。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-整个形式系统\">12. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>下列元组是元语言中的规格列表；含类谓词的分量不表示把所有集合结构收集为一个集合。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathbb N,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},⟦-⟧^{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALN}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathbb N,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},⟦-⟧^{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALN}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统不含完整存在限制、析取、任意概念否定、限定数目限制或角色层级；数目语义只解释非限定数目限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"717-ALN","text":"717 ALN","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-概念表达式","text":"2. 概念表达式","level":1},{"id":"3.-包含式与-TBox","text":"3. 包含式与 TBox","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由名字与替换","text":"4. 自由名字与替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导出关系","text":"8. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与解释","text":"9. 语义结构与解释","level":1},{"id":"10.-满足关系与语义后承","text":"10. 满足关系与语义后承","level":1},{"id":"11.-特征差异","text":"11. 特征差异","level":1},{"id":"12.-整个形式系统","text":"12. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)","display":false},{"tex":"N_C","display":false},{"tex":"N_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{atomneg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{forall},\n\\operatorname{existsTop},\\operatorname{atleast},\\operatorname{atmost}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{atomneg}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{conj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{forall}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{existsTop}:N_R\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atleast},\\operatorname{atmost}:\n\\mathbb N\\times N_R\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALN}}.","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\top=\\operatorname{top},\\quad\\bot=\\operatorname{bottom},\\quad\\neg A=\\operatorname{atomneg}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"C\\sqcap D=\\operatorname{conj}(C,D),\\quad\\forall R.C=\\operatorname{forall}(R,C),\\quad\\exists R.\\top=\\operatorname{existsTop}(R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\geq nR=\\operatorname{atleast}(n,R),\n\\qquad\n\\leq nR=\\operatorname{atmost}(n,R).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf